 for extra comfort. A 3-stripe logo on the tongue and the 3 stripes on the sides combine to showcase your adidas style as soon as you put on this shoe.</div><div data-ved="0CJQBEOynB2oXChMIyP2w--HAlAMVAAAAAB0AAAAAEDY" class="faASHf" style="" jsname="U6pnxc" aria-hidden="true"><div class="zOwEef"></div><div class="cRrHvd"><span class="X5GbCc">...</span><span>More</span><span class="xlR7We z1asCe" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px;"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7.41 8.59L12 13.17l4.59-4.58L18 10l-6 6-6-6 1.41-1.41z"></path></svg></span></div></div><div data-ved="0CJUBEOunB2oXChMIyP2w--HAlAMVAAAAAB0AAAAAEDY" class="rsx6fc" style="display:none;" jsname="jy5nuf" aria-hidden="true"><div class="zOwEef"></div><div class="SJQ6Xb"><span>Less</span><span class="xlR7We z1asCe" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px;"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7.41 15.41L12 10.83l4.59 4.58L18 14l-6-6-6 6z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ozDyDd iRPzcb"></div><div class="zzkrfd" style="padding-bottom:16px;margin:0 -16px;" jscontroller="mboIQ" jsname="UtT7xe" data-doc-strs="PC_413998328530206132|PROD_PC_413998328530206132" data-rvc="17" jsdata="S57vG;;391" jsaction="rcuQ6b:npT2md" data-ved="0CJYBEIHyBGoXChMIyP2w--HAlAMVAAAAAB0AAAAAEDY" data-hveid="150" data-product-title="Women adidas Cloudfoam Flex Elastic Lace Casual Shoes HQ4929" data-zds="PC_413998328530206132|PROD_PC_413998328530206132" jsmodel="CYXMoc" data-ipv="1"><div jsname="LvoS2c" data-ved="0CJcBEInyBGoXChMIyP2w--HAlAMVAAAAAB0AAAAAEDY" data-hveid="151"><div class="J4kPWd"><h3 class="y8JFS wTJCWe" role="heading"><span>User reviews</span></h3></div><div class="x38CKc"><div class="lsA2Je" jsname="yBAhOb"><div class="suYfQc"><div class="liSKFd"><div class="QGLeic" aria-hidden="true">5</div><div class="HPMWKd" aria-label="65% of review